---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About · Lorien Lab" description="About Lorien Lab's quantitative research interests and research philosophy.">
  <header class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="mono-label"><span class="lang-en">About</span><span class="lang-zh" lang="zh-CN">关于</span></div><h1><span class="lang-en">Quant research as<br/>a system of evidence.</span><span class="lang-zh" lang="zh-CN">把量化研究视为<br/>一套证据系统。</span></h1><p><span class="lang-en">I am interested in the full research loop: turning market hypotheses into measurable features, testing them under realistic constraints, and building infrastructure that makes the process reproducible.</span><span class="lang-zh" lang="zh-CN">我关注完整的研究闭环：把市场假设转化为可测量特征，在现实约束下进行检验，并构建让整个过程可复现的研究基础设施。</span></p></div></header>
  <section class="section"><div class="container about-grid"><div class="about-copy"><h2><span class="lang-en">Research philosophy</span><span class="lang-zh" lang="zh-CN">研究理念</span></h2><p><span class="lang-en">Good quantitative research is more than finding a backtest that works. It requires clear economic intuition, careful data construction, strong leakage controls, robust validation, and a way to understand why a signal succeeds or fails.</span><span class="lang-zh" lang="zh-CN">好的量化研究不只是找到一个“能赚钱的回测”。它需要清晰的经济逻辑、严谨的数据构造、严格的信息泄露控制、稳健验证，以及解释信号为何成功或失败的机制分析。</span></p><p><span class="lang-en">My current interests sit at the intersection of factor discovery, futures term structure, market microstructure, CTA-style systematic strategies, machine learning, and agent-assisted research infrastructure.</span><span class="lang-zh" lang="zh-CN">我目前的研究兴趣集中在因子发现、期货期限结构、市场微观结构、CTA 风格系统化策略、机器学习，以及 Agent 辅助研究基础设施的交叉区域。</span></p><p><span class="lang-en">I also care about the engineering layer around research: experiment lineage, modular operators, factor libraries, de-duplication, and interfaces that help humans and agents work on the same research objects without losing auditability.</span><span class="lang-zh" lang="zh-CN">我同样重视研究外围的工程层：实验谱系、模块化算子、因子库、去重机制，以及让人类与 Agent 能围绕同一研究对象协作、同时保持可审计性的接口。</span></p></div><aside class="about-aside card"><div class="mono-label"><span class="lang-en">Current themes</span><span class="lang-zh" lang="zh-CN">当前主题</span></div><ul><li><span class="lang-en">Automated alpha discovery</span><span class="lang-zh" lang="zh-CN">自动化 Alpha 发现</span></li><li><span class="lang-en">Futures curve and spread states</span><span class="lang-zh" lang="zh-CN">期货曲线与价差状态</span></li><li><span class="lang-en">Intraday → daily factor aggregation</span><span class="lang-zh" lang="zh-CN">日内 → 日频因子聚合</span></li><li><span class="lang-en">Systematic trend and reversal</span><span class="lang-zh" lang="zh-CN">系统化趋势与反转</span></li><li><span class="lang-en">LLM / RL / GP search algorithms</span><span class="lang-zh" lang="zh-CN">LLM / RL / GP 搜索算法</span></li><li><span class="lang-en">Research platform architecture</span><span class="lang-zh" lang="zh-CN">研究平台架构</span></li></ul></aside></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.page-hero h1>.lang-en,.page-hero h1>.lang-zh,.page-hero p>.lang-en,.page-hero p>.lang-zh,.about-copy h2>.lang-en,.about-copy h2>.lang-zh,.about-copy p>.lang-en,.about-copy p>.lang-zh,.about-aside li>.lang-en,.about-aside li>.lang-zh{display:block}.about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.35fr .65fr;gap:65px;align-items:start}.about-copy h2{font-size:2rem;letter-spacing:-.035em}.about-copy p{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.05rem}.about-aside{padding:24px;box-shadow:none}.about-aside ul{margin:18px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none}.about-aside li{padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);font-weight:650;font-size:.9rem}.about-aside li:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}@media(max-width:760px){.about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px}}</style>
